          "op": "union",
          "role": "ear_assembly"
        },
        {
          "description": "The declared outer envelope, used to trim the blended union. A blend between two operands that share a coplanar face has no concave crease to fill and adds a little material across that face; trimming states the intended outer dimensions explicitly so the envelope requirement is checkable rather than approximate.",
